WEBVTT

00:12:00.215 --> 00:12:03.177
I don't like a cursory,
you know, interaction,

00:12:03.177 --> 00:12:04.970
and I do not believe in networking.

00:12:05.220 --> 00:12:06.722
I like an authentic connection.

00:12:07.514 --> 00:12:09.975
I’m also curious and I’m adventurous

00:12:09.975 --> 00:12:11.268
and I’m kind

00:12:11.268 --> 00:12:12.644
and I’ve got big dreams.

00:12:13.228 --> 00:12:14.480
How am I being perceived?

00:12:14.688 --> 00:12:17.524
Well, y’all know
the nickname, Bitchy Bevy ...

00:12:17.524 --> 00:12:18.525
so, duh.

00:12:18.734 --> 00:12:19.902
But here’s the problem.

00:12:20.986 --> 00:12:23.697
There’s a lot of power in that persona,

00:12:23.697 --> 00:12:26.283
and I actually really enjoyed it
for a time, you know,

00:12:26.283 --> 00:12:28.619
because you can make
a lot of money being a bitch,

00:12:28.619 --> 00:12:29.745
especially in fashion.

00:12:29.953 --> 00:12:30.954
(Laughter)